# P12-MESH-004 audit: the pre-MESH-004 MeshQuality (snapshot /tmp/cfd_mesh003 = MESH-001..003 tree) on valid
# structured_quad grids rotated rigidly (scratch audit_aspect.cpp). A rotation changes no geometric quality.
# Finding: MeshQuality's aspect ratio sorted a cell's faces into 'vertical'/'horizontal' by axis alignment
# (cellExtents: |Sf.x| >= |Sf.y| -> vertical). At exactly 45 degrees every face is 'vertical', dx = 0, and the
# production validity gate declares the VALID mesh invalid with a misleading message:
